{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LAM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米哀歌","commonName":"耶利米哀歌","title":"耶利米哀歌","order":25,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"116b5eec352d92466c3407c484861baa5fe24f8d05cb718844c986cf0d754a57","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":154},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["淪陷的耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"黃金竟失去光澤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"純金竟變色，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寶石竟被棄之街頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"錫安的寶貝兒女本來貴如純金，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在竟被視為陶匠製作的瓦器！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"豺狼尚且哺養自己的幼兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓卻像荒野的鴕鳥般殘忍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"嬰兒乾渴難忍，舌頭緊貼上膛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孩童乞求食物，卻無人給予。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"昔日吃美味佳餚的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今在街頭窮困潦倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿錦衣紫袍長大的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今躺臥在糞堆中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"雖然無人攻擊，所多瑪卻在頃刻之間傾覆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓比所多瑪受到的懲罰更重。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"錫安的首領曾比雪純淨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"比奶更白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"身體比紅寶石更紅潤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"相貌美如藍寶石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"現在，他們的面目比煤炭還黑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走在街上無人認得。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們骨瘦如柴，乾如枯木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"死於刀下的勝過死於饑餓的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是因田間缺糧而餓死的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我的百姓遭毀滅時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"慈母親手煮自己的兒女充饑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和華大發烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傾倒祂的怒氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在錫安燃起大火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"焚毀城的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"地上的君王和世上的居民都不相信敵人能闖進耶路撒冷的城門。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"這都是因為她先知的罪行和祭司的過犯。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在城中殺害義人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"他們如盲人在街上遊蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沾滿血污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人敢碰他們的衣服。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"人們向他們喊道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「走開！你們是不潔的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"走開！走開！不要靠近我們。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是他們逃亡、流蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的人說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「他們不可再住在我們這裡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和華親自驅散他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再眷顧他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們不再尊重祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再恩待長老。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我們望眼欲穿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盼望援軍的到來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盼望的卻是無力拯救之國。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"敵人步步緊逼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我們不敢上自己的街。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的結局近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的日子到頭了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的結局來了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"追趕我們的人比飛鷹更快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在山上追捕我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在曠野伏擊我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"我們的生命之氣——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華膏立的王落入他們的陷阱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們原希望藉他的蔭庇立足於列國中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"你們住在烏斯地區的以東人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只管歡喜作樂吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為盛滿耶和華憤怒的杯也要傳到你們那裡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必喝醉，以致赤身露體。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安啊！你已經受到了應得的刑罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必不再使你流亡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女以東啊，耶和華要因你的罪過而懲罰你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揭露你的罪惡！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LAM/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}